        <id>https://youngforest.github.io/en/2023/05/15/rip-hao/</id>
        <title>In Deep Mourning for Haoel</title>
        <link rel="alternate" href="https://youngforest.github.io/en/2023/05/15/rip-hao/"/>
        <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;R.I.P.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I was fortunate to be in the same problem-solving group as 左耳朵耗子. When everyone heard the news, we thought it was a rumor and even mentioned him in the group. But with multiple sources confirming it, it should be true now.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;/images/hao-foxi.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;左耳朵耗子 chat history in the Buddhist Problem Solving group&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I first learned about him through &lt;a href=&#34;https://coolshell.cn/&#34;&gt;his blog 酷壳 - COOLSHELL&lt;/a&gt;, probably from the VIM series. At that time I was still in university and had just started studying computer science. His blog helped me a lot.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;/images/haoel.png&#34; alt=&#34;Self-introduction on 左耳朵耗子&amp;#39;s blog&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The closest I came to sudden death was in the first semester of my junior year, when I worked on a compiler lab until 6 a.m. At the time I felt something was wrong, and my heart felt uncomfortable. So I went back to the dorm and slept. From then on, I chose to lie flat: no more grinding, no more chasing endless upward progress. During graduate school, a sophomore in our school died suddenly in the library while working on a Computer Organization lab. I have also been through Computer Organization, and thinking about it, the pressure really was too much. After work, there are even sudden-death news stories in China’s computer industry every year.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Finally, I want to introduce a GitHub repo to fellow programmers: &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/geekan/HowToLiveLonger&#34;&gt;程序员延寿指南 geekan/HowToLiveLonger&lt;/a&gt;. Being alive is truly good. Cherish it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;/images/HowToLiveLonger.png&#34; alt=&#34;HowToLiveLonger README&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</content>
